                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://brownphotographic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/9/20240203_20240203_153818-VSCO-2xl.jpg" alt="" />
                    For the past 16+ years I have helped physical AI companies through the hardest transition they will face: R&amp;D &gt;&gt; real deployable product &gt;&gt; scale. How I lead: Low ego, teacher, and elevator. I teach instead of dictate, because a team given responsibility outperforms one&hellip;
                ]]>
