            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://brownphotographic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/9/20240203_20240203_153818-VSCO-2xl.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For the past 16+ years I have helped physical AI companies through the hardest transition they will face: R&amp;D &gt;&gt; real deployable product &gt;&gt; scale.</span></p>
<p><strong>How I lead:</strong></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Low ego, teacher, and elevator. I teach instead of dictate, because a team given responsibility outperforms one that just follows orders. I lead alongside my team: doing the work with them. My passion is to find team members opportunities to grow and make sure they get seen for it. This is what motivates me.</span></p>
