        <updated>2026-09-19T23:00:00-04:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://brownphotographic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/3/PXL_20250115_231927917-2.jpg" alt="" />
                    As Head of Product at Kodiak, I helped build and launch the world's first driverless commercial trucking fleet, now running 24/7 in the Permian Basin. I am currently leading Product for Kodiak Defense, applying that same autonomy stack to ground autonomy programs for the US&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://brownphotographic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/3/PXL_20250115_231927917-2.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">As Head of Product at Kodiak, I helped build and launch the world's first driverless commercial trucking fleet, now running 24/7 in the Permian Basin. I am currently leading Product for Kodiak Defense, applying that same autonomy stack to ground autonomy programs for the US Army, US Marines, and NATO. I help build and nurture close partnerships with major defense primes and OEMs including Textron, GDLS, and US vehicle OEMs.</span></p>
<p><strong>Kodiak </strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">‐ </span><strong>Head of Product, Defense</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">2025 - Present</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Driving product management for military ground robotics for US Army, US Marines, and NATO countries.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Supporting business development, commercial and technical partnerships with leading defense primes and suppliers. </span></li>
</ul>
<figure class="post__video"><iframe loading="lazy" width="750" height="421" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/3KNRxE4moCE?si=NEW84dX8AO4bb0xC" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-mce-fragment="1"></iframe></figure>
