<p><strong>Kodiak </strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">‐ </span><strong>Head of Product</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">: Autonomous Trucking for Commercial, and Industrial</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">2022 - 2025</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Lead and grew Product and Technical Program Management teams for Level 4 Class 8 self driving trucking.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Working directly with customers to understand existing processes and develop custom solutions.</span></li>
</ul>
<figure class="post__video"><iframe loading="lazy" width="750" height="421" src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/bwrZV-s2_HM?si=k6nFP4bn6CtxqEyh" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" data-mce-fragment="1"></iframe></figure>
