        <updated>2026-09-19T22:00:00-04:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://brownphotographic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/motional_ioniq_5.jpg" alt="" />
                    I joined nuTonomy as its first Product Manager (around the time of its acquisition by Delphi/Aptiv) helping the R&amp;D heavy team ship its first driverless product. As Senior Product Director at the resulting Motional, I led product and industrial design for our first driver-out robotaxi&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://brownphotographic.github.io/rb-web/media/posts/4/motional_ioniq_5.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I joined nuTonomy as its first Product Manager (around the time of its acquisition by Delphi/Aptiv) helping the R&amp;D heavy team ship its first driverless product. As Senior Product Director at the resulting Motional, I led product and industrial design for our first driver-out robotaxi deployment (2021), and partnered with Hyundai in South Korea to co-develop the award winning IONIQ 5 robotaxi.</span></p>
<p><strong>Motional</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;"> - </span><strong>Senior Product Director</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">: Level 4 Robotaxi and Last Mile Delivery in Las Vegas &amp; LA</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">2020 – 2022</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Lead Industrial Design and UX prototyping, to design and produce the Motional Ioniq 5 Robotaxi with Hyundai.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Lead requirements and market analysis for Level 4 automation and B2B integration with Lyft and Uber.</span></li>
</ul>
<p><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Article:</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><a href="https://www.wsj.com/articles/motional-previews-the-self-driving-taxi-experience-with-lyft-as-its-first-partner-11634243135?reflink=desktopwebshare_permalink"><span style="font-weight: 400;">WSJ Robotaxi user experience</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span></p>
