<p><strong>nuTonomy </strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">- </span><strong>Senior Product Manager</strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">:</span><strong> </strong><span style="font-weight: 400;">Level 4 Robotaxi (Boston, Singapore, and Las Vegas)</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> </span><span style="font-weight: 400;">2018 - 2020 </span></p>
