                <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">My path into physical AI started with maps. I hold a Master's in Geographical Information Science (Distinction) from the University of Nottingham, and a BSc in Geography and Topographic Science from Swansea University. While my studies in the technical challenges of sensing, mapping and localization were before the time of integration into robotics, this foundation has served me well in every application of automation.</span></p>
